    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1485">

                <pb facs="1120" n="1004" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1004"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.12/20.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consul General
                    Hanna</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 30, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Brazilian Minister, Mexico City, reports that Archbishops of Guadalajara and
                    Monterey fear for safety of persons and properties themselves and other Bishops
                    in case Constitutionalists take Mexico City. Say to Carranza that it is hoped he
                    will order full <pb facs="1121" n="1005" xml:id="pg1005"/> protection to be
                    given persons and properties of all persons connected with religious
                    organizations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
